      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَقُولٌ</span></b>  A medicine <i>that binds, confines,</i> or
<i>astringes, the belly</i> [or <i>bowels</i>]; (S, O, Msb;) as
also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَاقُولٌ</span></b> ; <i>contr. of</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَادُورٌ</span>. (A in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حدر</span>.) ＝ 
 
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَاقِلٌ</span>, latter half, in two places.

